    %% Regulation
    L --> Q[ATP/ADP Ratio]
    Q --> R{Energy Demand?}
    R -->|High| S[Increased Respiration]
    R -->|Low| T[Decreased Respiration]
    
    %% Key proteins
    U[Complex I] --> C
    V[Complex II] --> D
    W[Complex III] --> E
    X[Complex IV] --> F
    Y[ATP Synthase] --> J
    Z[Uncoupling Proteins] --> N
    AA[ADP] --> K
    BB[ATP] --> L
    
